{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "As Cool as a Cucumber", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. <br/><br/>The combination of the verb and preposition changes the meaning of the verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some phrasal verbs related to work:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "to work towards -- to take actions hoping to achieve a specific goal<br/>to come up -- to think of<br/>to go over -- to review, to study<br/>to go along -- to accept, to agree to<br/>to go out -- to leave the house, to go to a place or places in the town or city<br/>to come out -- to join people socially <br/>to come back -- to return to a place<br/>to check out -- to experience for the first time<br/>to make sure -- to verify<br/>to run into -- to meet someone without planning<br/>to set up -- to arrange, to organize<br/>to get along -- to be friendly, enjoy being with someone<br/>to follow up -- to ask questions or make comments after a decision or meeting", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You conjugate phrasal verbs in the same way you conjugate other verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I go out on Saturdays.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you go out on Saturdays?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am going out this evening.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are you going out this evening?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I went out last Saturday.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Did you go out last Saturday?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have gone out every Saturday this month. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Have you gone out every Saturday this month?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect tense\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "It was fun to check out Bistro 88. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Next time I go out with some friends for a meal, we'll come here.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking and Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this. Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the structure:<br/>Can/Could + you + show/tell+ me+ Question word", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how to make lasagna?<br/>Could you show me where the washrooms are?<br/>Could you tell me what is on the dessert menu?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To give advice, you can use the structure:<br/>Let me show/tell + you + question word", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Let me show you where it is.<br/>Let me tell you what you should do.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Can you tell me what is the most interesting part of your job?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Could you explain to me how you deal with problems?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "design", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way an object or environment appears, after careful thought and planning", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The food is great and the design is so cool!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "clientele", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the people who purchase goods or services, like meals at a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our clientele expects great service, so we need to deliver!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to make sure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to verify", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have to make sure everyone follows the plan.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to go along", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to accept, to agree to", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sometimes employees don't always go along with the roles they have been assigned to. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to work towards", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take actions with the hope of reaching a specific goal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: After all, we're all working towards the same goal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss ways you stay calm in difficult situations. Try to think of 8 - 10 things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online to find 5 more techniques.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph giving advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use expressions for advice, like <span class=\"italic\">You ought to ...</span> and <span class=\"italic\">You might want to ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I discuss and read about ways of staying calm.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph giving advice on how to stay calm.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That was a great meal, Vanessa.  It was fun to check out Bistro 88. The food is great and the design is so cool!<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thank you! I'm glad you came to try it out. I wish we served lemon baked cod every day! You might want to try it before the menu changes again. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Next time I go out with some friends for a meal, we'll come back.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure! It's always fun to run into people I know. I wish Sally came out with us more often. You ought to invite her.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can you tell me what is the most interesting part of your job? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The people who work here get along very well. We're like a big family! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could you tell me what is the most difficult part?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sometimes employees don't always go along with the roles they have been assigned to. You have to go over their schedule a few times, and follow up after we make decisions.", "time": "31500"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could you explain to me how you deal with problems?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The times that are stressful, you had better stay cool as a cucumber. Also, you have to make sure you communicate clearly.  I wish everyone understood that we're all working towards the same goal.  Our clientele expects great service, so we need to deliver!", "time": "54000"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about jobs, work, and social activities. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask for help or advice, and talk about what is advisable.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What are some times that you find stressful? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What are some occasions that you need to ask for help or advice? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feed